# NAME: OpenAI Complete for Surge
# UPDATED: 2026-10-10
# FORMAT: Surge RULE-SET (.list), without policy names
# SOURCES:
# https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9247338-network-recommendations-for-chatgpt-errors-on-web-and-apps
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Surge/OpenAI/OpenAI.list
# SCOPE: ChatGPT, Codex, OpenAI API, Sora and their common dependencies
# NOTE: Shared third-party domains may also be used by other applications.

# === 1. OpenAI services / authentication / API / static assets ===
